<title>USA: SubMicron Systems sees &quot;significant&quot; losses.</title>
<headline>SubMicron Systems sees &quot;significant&quot; losses.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SubMicron Systems Corp said Wednesday it expects significant losses from operations in both the first and second quarters of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it would provide more details when it announces its first quarter 1997 earnings on May 14.</p>
</text>
